SUMMARY:Great Smokies Writing Program Founders' Keynote
DESCRIPTION:The Great Smokies Writing Program welcomes founders Richard Chess and Tommy Hays for an evening of readings and conversation on July 25 from 6:30–8 p.m. in the Blue Ridge Room of Highsmith Student Union. The authors will read from their new books and discuss their work\, the writer’s life\, and the founding of the Great Smokies Writing Program. \nRefreshments will be served. Tickets are available at unca.edu/greatsmokies\, with proceeds supporting the Great Smokies Writing Program.
URL:https://www.unca.edu/event/great-smokies-writing-program-founders-keynote/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.unca.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Event-Calendar-TEMPLATE-14.png
END:VEVENT
